  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Syria Humanitarian Response Programme: Health Pillar - Undisclosed Partner SHRP A</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health pillar focused on maintaining essential health services, including primary and secondary care, trauma and emergency services, maternal and newborn health, disease surveillance, and mental health and psychosocial support across the Whole of Syria. Financing includes medical supplies, equipment, health worker training, and mobile medical teams to reach displaced and hard-to-access populations across Syria.</narrative>
  </description>
